{"id":"v3","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":3,"of":8,"title":"Making it happen","titleHe":"בִּנְיַן הִפְעִיל","goal":"Recognise hif'il and its causative sense.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"הִפְעִיל usually means causing the action rather than doing it. Its present begins with מַ and has a long i in the middle; its past begins with הִ."},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"present","rows":[{"label":"masculine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּיר"},{"label":"feminine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"masculine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירִים"},{"label":"feminine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירוֹת"}]},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"past","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"הִסְבַּרְתִּי"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"הִסְבַּרְתָּ"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְתְּ"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"הִסְבִּיר"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"הִסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְנוּ"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּם"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּן"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"הִסְבִּירוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"The causative link is often visible across binyanim on one root. From ל־ב־ש: לוֹבֵשׁ wears, מַלְבִּישׁ dresses someone else, מִתְלַבֵּשׁ gets dressed."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מַסְבִּיר","en":"explains","translit":"masbir"},{"he":"מַתְחִיל","en":"begins","translit":"matchil"},{"he":"מַרְגִּישׁ","en":"feels","translit":"margish"},{"he":"מַזְמִין","en":"invites, orders","translit":"mazmin"},{"he":"מַכִּיר","en":"knows, is acquainted with","translit":"makir"},{"he":"מַחְלִיט","en":"decides","translit":"machlit"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["to learn","sea","explains","for example"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַסְבִּיר","translit":"masbir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["football","land, country","begins","and it came to pass"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַתְחִיל","translit":"matchil"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["him, it","feels","specifically, of all things","when"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מַרְגִּישׁ","translit":"margish"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["window","invites, orders","development","there is, there are"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מַזְמִין","translit":"mazmin"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["knows, is acquainted with","hears","a lot, many","to learn"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מַכִּיר","translit":"makir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["his","decides","beginning","is located, is found"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מַחְלִיט","translit":"machlit"},{"type":"choice","q":"Which binyan is this verb in?","options":["הִתְפַּעֵל","הִפְעִיל","פִּעֵל","פָּעַל"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מִתְלַבֵּשׁ"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “explains”?","options":["שֹׁרֶשׁ","מַסְבִּיר","גַּג","שָׁמַיִם"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — masculine singular, present","options":["מַסְבִּירָה","מַסְבִּיר","מַסְבִּירוֹת","מַסְבִּירִים"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: masculine singular is מַסְבִּיר."},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מַכִּיר","knows, is acquainted with"],["מַחְלִיט","decides"],["מַסְבִּיר","explains"],["מַרְגִּישׁ","feels"],["מַזְמִין","invites, orders"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “begins”?","options":["לָהּ","רֹאשׁ","מַתְחִיל","רוֹאֶה"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"מַכִּיר","translit":"makir","en":"knows, is acquainted with"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “decides”?","options":["תֵּן","בַּיִת","מַכִּיר","מַחְלִיט"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"listen